{"id":15051,"mal_id":15051,"title":"Love Live! School Idol Project","englishTitle":"Love Live! School Idol Project","title_english":"Love Live! School Idol Project","alternative_titles":{"synonyms":[],"en":"Love Live! School Idol Project","ja":"ラブライブ! School idol project"},"synopsis":"Otonokizaka High School is in a crisis! With the number of enrolling students dropping lower and lower every year, the school is set to shut down after its current first years graduate. However, second year Honoka Kousaka refuses to let it go without a fight. Searching for a solution, she comes across popular school idol group A-RISE and sets out to create a school idol group of her own. With the help of her childhood friends Umi Sonoda and Kotori Minami, Honoka forms μ's (pronounced \"muse\") to boost awareness and popularity of her school.\n\nUnfortunately, it's all easier said than done. Student council president Eri Ayase vehemently opposes the establishment of a school idol group and will do anything in her power to prevent its creation. Moreover, Honoka and her friends have trouble attracting any additional members. But the Love Live, a competition to determine the best and most beloved school idol groups in Japan, can help them gain the attention they desperately need. With the contest fast approaching, Honoka must act quickly and diligently to try and bring together a school idol group and win the Love Live in order to save Otonokizaka High School.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]","synopsis_es":"¡La escuela secundaria Otonokizaka está en crisis! Dado que el número de estudiantes matriculados disminuye cada año, la escuela cerrará después de que se gradúen los actuales primeros años. Sin embargo, Honoka Kousaka, de segundo año, se niega a dejarlo pasar sin luchar. Buscando una solución, se encuentra con el popular grupo de ídolos escolares A-RISE y se propone crear su propio grupo de ídolos escolares. Con la ayuda de sus amigas de la infancia Umi Sonoda y Kotori Minami, Honoka forma μ's (pronunciado \"musa\") para aumentar el conocimiento y la popularidad de su escuela.\n\nDesafortunadamente, es más fácil decirlo que hacerlo. La presidenta del consejo estudiantil, Eri Ayase, se opone vehementemente al establecimiento de un grupo de ídolos escolares y hará todo lo que esté en su poder para evitar su creación. Además, Honoka y sus amigos tienen problemas para atraer miembros adicionales. Pero Love Live, una competencia para determinar los mejores y más queridos grupos de ídolos escolares en Japón, puede ayudarlos a obtener la atención que necesitan desesperadamente. Con el concurso acercándose rápidamente, Honoka debe actuar rápida y diligentemente para intentar reunir un grupo de ídolos escolares y ganar el Love Live para salvar la escuela secundaria Otonokizaka.\n\n[Escrito por MAL Rewrite]","type":"TV","media_type":"tv","status":"finished_airing","averageEpisodeDurationSeconds":1420,"average_episode_duration":1420,"startDate":"2013-01-06","start_date":"2013-01-06","endDate":"2013-03-31","end_date":"2013-03-31","season":"winter","year":2013,"start_season":{"year":2013,"season":"winter"},"episodes":13,"num_episodes":13,"score":7.41,"mean":7.41,"numListUsers":474767,"num_list_users":474767,"genres":[{"id":60,"name":"Idols (Female)"},{"id":19,"name":"Music"},{"id":23,"name":"School"},{"id":36,"name":"Slice of Life"}],"studios":[{"id":14,"name":"Sunrise"}],"pictures":[],"backdrop_url":null,"logo_url":null,"tmdb_id":null,"tmdb_updated_at":null,"images":{"jpg":{"image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/11/56849.webp","large_image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/11/56849l.webp"}},"main_picture":{"medium":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/11/56849.webp","large":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/11/56849l.webp"},"trailer":{"images":{"maximum_image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/11/56849l.webp"}},"broadcast":{"day":"sunday","time":"22:00","day_of_the_week":"sunday","start_time":"22:00","timezone":"Asia/Tokyo","string":"sunday 22:00"},"rank":2639,"popularity":569,"rating":"pg_13","simkl_id":null,"episodes_data":[],"specials_data":[],"characters":[],"num_scoring_users":237722,"nsfw":"white","created_at":"2012-08-05T17:34:39+00:00","updated_at":"2026-08-11T06:47:43+00:00","source":"other","background":"Love Live! School Idol Project is a part of the \"Love Live!\" multimedia franchise, co-developed with Dengeki G's Magazine. In 2015, idol group μ's was Japan's eighth best-selling musical act, selling over eight hundred thousand CDs, DVDs, and Blu-Rays.\n\nThe series also released a mobile rhythm game titled Love Live! School Idol Festival for iOS and Android, developed by KLab, which was released in 2013 for Japan and in 2014 for English users. As of March 22, 2016, the game has surpassed 25 million users worldwide.","related_anime":[{"node":{"id":9907,"title":"Bokura no Live Kimi to no Life","main_picture":{"medium":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/12/50113.webp","large":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/12/50113l.webp"}},"relation_type":"other","relation_type_formatted":"Other"},{"node":{"id":9930,"title":"Snow Halation","main_picture":{"medium":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/7/60873.webp","large":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/7/60873l.webp"}},"relation_type":"other","relation_type_formatted":"Other"},{"node":{"id":11033,"title":"Natsu-iro Egao de 1, 2, Jump!","main_picture":{"medium":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/8/30959.jpg","large":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/8/30959l.jpg"}},"relation_type":"other","relation_type_formatted":"Other"},{"node":{"id":12637,"title":"Mogyutto \"Love\" de Sekkinchuu!","main_picture":{"medium":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/6/40821.jpg","large":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/6/40821l.jpg"}},"relation_type":"other","relation_type_formatted":"Other"},{"node":{"id":14951,"title":"Wonderful Rush","main_picture":{"medium":"https://cdn.myanimelist.